WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
Operational evidence
joins application events,

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:06.960
gateway decisions and reviewer
feedback by run identifier.

00:00:07.022 --> 00:00:11.600
Preserve event integrity while minimizing
sensitive payloads and applying retention

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:16.240
rules. Operations uses failures
and tail latency; platform owners

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:20.880
inspect tool patterns and denials;
evaluation owners curate reviewed cases.

00:00:21.056 --> 00:00:25.680
This shared evidence makes incidents
actionable and feeds future checks.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.800
A monitoring dashboard
without reliable joins

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:31.920
cannot explain how a particular
result was produced.
